/T (Mortality Charge: This charge is deducted by cancellation of units at the beginning of every policy month as 1/12th of the annual Mortality Charge. It will depend on your attained age and the Sum at Risk which is base death benefit in excess of base fund value \(fund value is after deduction of all charges except Mortality charge\). Sum at risk for top-ups is top-up death benefit in excess of top-up fund value \(fund value is after deduction of all charges except mortality charge\). The Mortality Charge will be deducted up to the date of death only.)
/E (Mortality Charge: This charge is deducted by cancellation of units at the beginning of every policy month as 1/12th of the annual Mortality Charge. It will depend on your attained age and the Sum at Risk which is base death benefit in excess of base fund value \(fund value is after deduction of all charges except Mortality charge\). Sum at risk for top-ups is top-up death benefit in excess of top-up fund value \(fund value is after deduction of all charges except mortality charge\). The Mortality Charge will be deducted up to the date of death only.)
